sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant API as Shortener API
    participant DB as URL DB
    participant C as Cache

    U->>API: POST /shorten {long_url}
    API->>C: cache get long_url
    C-->>API: miss
    API->>DB: insert mapping
    DB-->>API: short_code=abc12X
    API->>C: cache set
    API-->>U: {short_url: https://go/abc12X}
